{"id":"4afc993386881d3c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-subset-sum.md","title":"SUBSET-SUM","display":"df-subset-sum — SUBSET-SUM","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-subset-sum","aliases":["28-df-subset-sum","SUBSET-SUM"],"display":"df-subset-sum — SUBSET-SUM","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-subset-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-subset-sum</span><span>SUBSET-SUM</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subset-sum — SUBSET-SUM"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 是自然数的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；字串相邻表示连接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^m\\times\\mathbb N)\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^m\\times\\mathbb N)\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 由下式定义；空列表的连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\ \\middle|\\\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\land(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in\\mathbb N^m\\land B\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\sum_{i\\in I}a_i=B\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\ \\middle|\\\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\land(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in\\mathbb N^m\\land B\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\sum_{i\\in I}a_i=B\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入长度是所有数的二进制位长之和；改成一元编码会改变复杂性。空子集之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，重复数按序列中的不同位置处理。</p>\n<p>来源核对：例2.3及习题2.17、2.31；印刷40、65–66页；PDF66、91–92页。定义及编码敏感性已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}:\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^m\\times\\mathbb N)\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SS}}(a_1,\\ldots,a_m,B)\\ \\middle|\\\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\land(a_1,\\ldots,a_m)\\in\\mathbb N^m\\land B\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\sum_{i\\in I}a_i=B\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1523,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"数值问题：[[28-df-subset-sum]]、[[28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"f3d33b2db2a9723b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}